	 * one of them holds while standing still. Moving a {@code @ConfigItem} between sections
	 * changes where the settings screen draws it and nothing else; the key is untouched, so
	 * nobody's saved pose moves. One pose for the whole roster rather than one per slot is
	 * still the shape — see the class javadoc.
	 */
	@ConfigItem(
		keyName = "idlePose",
		name = "Idle pose",
		description = "What every follower holds while it is standing still. \"The figure's own\" "
